{"id":"pam_faildelay.8","n":"pam_faildelay","s":"8","src":{"r":{"pkg":"pam","ver":"1.5.1-26.el9_6","repo":"BaseOS","url":"https://dl.rockylinux.org/vault/rocky/9.6/BaseOS/x86_64/os/Packages/p/pam-1.5.1-26.el9_6.x86_64.rpm","path":"/usr/share/man/man8/pam_faildelay.8.gz","sha256":"0eb9874591978c4b224b28d963933aeae99ecc8301fede1b366e059e21d8c1c1","date":"11/25/2020","origin":"Linux-PAM Manual"},"u":{"pkg":"libpam-modules","ver":"1.4.0-11ubuntu2.8","repo":"jammy-updates/main","url":"http://archive.ubuntu.com/ubuntu/pool/main/p/pam/libpam-modules_1.4.0-11ubuntu2.8_amd64.deb","path":"/usr/share/man/man8/pam_faildelay.8.gz","sha256":"5dea19867b356853b5d47d75ddf5e1ee240da12d6e897fadcdaec618a5737b2b","date":"06/08/2020","origin":"Linux-PAM Manual"}},"nopt":{"r":0,"u":0},"desc":"Change the delay on failure per-application","same":false,"r":[["NAME","<p>pam_faildelay - Change the delay on failure per-application</p>"],["SYNOPSIS","<p><b>pam_faildelay.so</b> [debug] [delay=<i>microseconds</i>]</p>"],["DESCRIPTION","<p>pam_faildelay is a PAM module that can be used to set the delay on failure per-application.</p> <p>If no <b>delay</b> is given, pam_faildelay will use the value of FAIL_DELAY from /etc/login.defs.</p>"],["OPTIONS","<dl><dt><b>debug</b></dt><dd>Turns on debugging messages sent to syslog.</dd></dl> <dl><dt><b>delay=</b><i>N</i></dt><dd>Set the delay on failure to N microseconds.</dd></dl>"],["MODULE TYPES PROVIDED","<p>Only the <b>auth</b> module type is provided.</p>"],["RETURN VALUES","<p>PAM_IGNORE</p> <div class=\"in\">Delay was successful adjusted.</div> <p>PAM_SYSTEM_ERR</p> <div class=\"in\">The specified delay was not valid.</div>"],["EXAMPLES","<p>The following example will set the delay on failure to 10 seconds:</p>  <div class=\"in\"> <pre>auth  optional  pam_faildelay.so  delay=10000000\n<br>\n      </pre> </div>"],["SEE ALSO","<p><b>pam_fail_delay</b>(3), <b>pam.conf</b>(5), <b>pam.d</b>(5), <b>pam</b>(8)</p>"],["AUTHOR","<p>pam_faildelay was written by Darren Tucker &lt;dtucker@zip.com.au&gt;.</p>"]],"u":[["NAME",0],["SYNOPSIS",1],["DESCRIPTION",2],["OPTIONS",3],["MODULE TYPES PROVIDED",4],["RETURN VALUES",5],["EXAMPLES",6],["SEE ALSO","<p><b>pam_fail_delay</b>(3), <b>pam.conf</b>(5), <b>pam.d</b>(5), <b>pam</b>(7)</p>"],["AUTHOR",8]],"diff":{"r":[],"u":[]}}